f not previously covered) .", "reference_indexes": [3, 4]}, {"snippet": "Family Size & Age: There is no cap on family size, age, or gender under the scheme.", "reference_indexes": [5, 6]}, {"snippet": "Pre-existing Conditions: All pre-existing diseases are covered from day one."}], "reference_indexes": [1, 6]}, {"type": "paragraph", "snippet": "Would you like to know more about eligibility criteria or how to apply for an Ayushman Bharat card?"}], "references": [{"index": 0, "title": "What is the Limit of the Ayushman Card? - Star Health Insurance", "link": "https://www.starhealth.in/answers/what-is-the-limit-of-the-ayushman-card/", "snippet": "Jan Arogya Yojana (AB-PMJAY) is a national health insurance scheme that aims at providing a coverage limit of up to ₹5 lakh per family per year of coverage.", "source": "Star Health Insurance", "source_icon": "https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/faviconV2?url=https://www.starhealth.in&client=AIM&size=128&type=FAVICON&fallback_opts=TYPE,SIZE,URL", "thumbnail": "https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcQHvA6O_25VI8eMtxe7tDCroZU9HPlxdI6dhJ6VNgzUI8_4xLebhZmq2CzFwneBkFGxuzlZ59cWjdlWJ-D9mL_JJSZvX6uZWHygB5Rp"}, {"index": 1, "title": "Ayushman Bharat: Pradhan Mantri Jan Arogya Yojana", "link": "https://www.tataaig.com/knowledge-center/health-insurance/ayushman-bharat-pradhan-mantri-jan-arogya-yojana", "snippet": "Coverage: ₹5 lakh per family annually with 100% free cashless treatment, covering pre-hospitalisation (3 days), post-hospitalisation (15 days), and pre-existing co...", "source": "TATA AIG", "source_icon": "https://encrypted-tbn1.gstatic.com/faviconV2?url=https://www.tataaig.com&client=AIM&size=128&type=FAVICON&fallback_opts=TYPE,SIZE,URL", "thumbnail": "https://encrypted-tbn3.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcQW6l380HImAMOWGv7M5Ka6Sdrolk6y9sjl6LHZvMiGQeflmgDN5oz8qhG7WU_3C4vU05eXNaRM3YoWkhP4LAV5zd160aUtX7_csMmz"}, {"index": 2, "title": "Ayushman Bharat Health Insurance Scheme - HDFC Bank", "link": "https://www.hdfc.b